==Prerequisites==
Boost headers (libboost-dev), ncurses (libncurses-dev). No compiled
Boost library is needed.

"make" creates an executable file called "bastet", that's all you need to run the program.

Key bindings and high scores are kept in the player's data folder,
$XDG_DATA_HOME/bastet (~/.local/share/bastet when XDG_DATA_HOME is not
set; %APPDATA%\bastet on Windows), so the game needs no setgid and no
system-wide score file.
